Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.25,0:00:04.53,TL,,0,0,0,,年初四连败 年末第一次入围总决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.53,0:00:05.91,TL,,0,0,0,,科博利的这一年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.91,0:00:08.90,TL,,0,0,0,,中间隔着多少次重新出发？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.35,0:00:10.97,TL,,0,0,0,,从联合杯到澳网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.97,0:00:12.71,TL,,0,0,0,,再到蒙彼利埃和达拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.71,0:00:14.59,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}场单打连败
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.59,0:00:17.63,TL,,0,0,0,,这个赛季 他的开局很难
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.01,0:00:22.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Fery's second break in the third set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N费里在第三盘第二次破发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.83,0:00:28.25,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Scoreline looking very, very positive for the Brit.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比分对这位英国选手非常有利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.61,0:00:49.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And on debut, Arthur Fery is through to the second round.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N澳网首秀 费里闯进第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.83,0:00:53.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's a huge win. Straight sets.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N一场大胜 直落三盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.78,0:00:55.10,TL,,0,0,0,,直到德尔雷比奇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.10,0:00:57.95,TL,,0,0,0,,他才又连续赢球 打进四强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.95,0:00:59.70,TL,,0,0,0,,接下来的阿卡普尔科
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.70,0:01:02.54,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次 他把奖杯带走了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.99,0:01:05.70,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}击败蒂亚福
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.70,0:01:08.74,TL,,0,0,0,,拿下生涯首座硬地巡回赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.74,0:01:12.18,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}500{\fs68}分到手 赛季终于有了亮色
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.02,0:01:18.90,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Acapulco belongs to Flavio.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阿卡普尔科 属于弗拉维奥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.90,0:01:21.42,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Cobolli the champion.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N科博利 冠军！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.18,0:01:25.84,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A second ATP 500 title.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第二座五百分赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.73,0:01:28.56,TL,,0,0,0,,印第安维尔斯第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.56,0:01:30.05,TL,,0,0,0,,迈阿密首战失利
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.05,0:01:31.77,TL,,0,0,0,,蒙特卡洛第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.77,0:01:35.10,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}月到{\fs78}4{\fs68}月 成绩仍有起伏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.55,0:01:38.30,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}月的慕尼黑 他在半决赛{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.30,0:01:40.61,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}击败兹维列夫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.61,0:01:42.24,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛输给谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:44.65,TL,,0,0,0,,也拿到了{\fs78}330{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.33,0:01:57.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ben Shelton is the 2026 BMW Open by Bitpanda champion here in Munich.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N谢尔顿是二〇二六年慕尼黑冠军！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.53,0:02:00.47,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Runner-up 12 months ago.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N十二个月前 他是亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.70,0:02:03.94,TL,,0,0,0,,马德里击败梅德韦德夫 打进八强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.94,0:02:06.80,TL,,0,0,0,,罗马第三轮 汉堡首轮出局之后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.80,0:02:09.12,TL,,0,0,0,,他带着起伏来到巴黎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.57,0:02:12.44,TL,,0,0,0,,他先连赢{\fs78}5{\fs68}场 打进四强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.44,0:02:14.41,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛阿纳尔迪赛前退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.41,0:02:17.54,TL,,0,0,0,,科博利第一次站上大满贯决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.98,0:02:20.74,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛对面 又是兹维列夫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.74,0:02:21.95,TL,,0,0,0,,第四盘抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.95,0:02:23.99,TL,,0,0,0,,科博利把比赛拖进决胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.99,0:02:25.98,TL,,0,0,0,,冠军还没有分出
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.32,0:03:13.33,TL,,0,0,0,,第五盘{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 他与冠军擦肩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.33,0:03:15.36,TL,,0,0,0,,法网亚军的{\fs78}1300{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.36,0:03:18.51,TL,,0,0,0,,是他本季最大的一笔单站积分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.96,0:03:22.25,TL,,0,0,0,,哈雷首轮出局 温网又打进八强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.25,0:03:24.44,TL,,0,0,0,,第四轮{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘淘汰德米纳尔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.44,0:03:26.44,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛输给费里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.44,0:03:28.77,TL,,0,0,0,,连续第二年停在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.07,0:03:36.09,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, what days these are for Arthur Fery!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N费里迎来了多么美好的日子！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.87,0:03:44.87,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The British wild card in the semi-finals of Wimbledon.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这位英国外卡选手 闯进温网半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.12,0:03:47.76,TL,,0,0,0,,乌马格和加拿大站都没赢球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.76,0:03:50.90,TL,,0,0,0,,来到辛辛那提 他连续{\fs78}4{\fs68}场打满{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.90,0:03:53.42,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次闯进大师赛四强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.87,0:03:55.81,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛逆转保罗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.81,0:03:57.76,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛输给菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.76,0:03:58.88,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}400{\fs68}分到手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.88,0:04:02.42,TL,,0,0,0,,科博利继续向第一次年终总决赛靠近
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.98,0:04:11.54,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is Arthur Fils into the final here in Cincinnati.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N菲斯打进辛辛那提决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.16,0:04:14.12,TL,,0,0,0,,美网首轮 两盘落后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.12,0:04:17.03,TL,,0,0,0,,他连扳{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘击败科梅萨尼亚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.03,0:04:19.46,TL,,0,0,0,,第二轮再逆转斯库尔凯特
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.46,0:04:21.86,TL,,0,0,0,,第三轮输给布洛克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.76,0:04:31.36,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}One of the performances of Alexander Blockx's career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N布洛克斯职业生涯的代表作之一
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.94,0:04:35.18,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}One of the performances in the U.S. Open so far.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N也是本届美网至今的代表作之一
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.91,0:04:41.03,TL,,0,0,0,,北京和上海 他又连续输掉首战
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.03,0:04:42.93,TL,,0,0,0,,赛季最后的室内硬地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.93,0:04:46.14,TL,,0,0,0,,能否拿到门票 依然没有答案
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.59,0:04:49.59,TL,,0,0,0,,来到里昂 他在半决赛拿到{\fs78}4{\fs68}个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.59,0:04:51.59,TL,,0,0,0,,却还是输给穆塞蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.59,0:04:52.65,TL,,0,0,0,,错过的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.65,0:04:55.61,TL,,0,0,0,,让这段冲刺多了一层波折
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.06,0:04:58.50,TL,,0,0,0,,维也纳第二轮 面对贝雷蒂尼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.50,0:05:00.96,TL,,0,0,0,,他在首盘{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}时伤退
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.96,0:05:02.21,TL,,0,0,0,,随后退出巴黎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.21,0:05:05.44,TL,,0,0,0,,自己已经无法再上场争取积分
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.89,0:05:09.39,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}11{\fs68}月{\fs78}3{\fs68}日晚 鲁德在巴黎击败霍达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.39,0:05:10.34,TL,,0,0,0,,这个结果
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.34,0:05:13.88,TL,,0,0,0,,让科博利第一次锁定年终总决赛资格
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.33,0:05:17.11,TL,,0,0,0,,门票在场外落定 通往都灵的路
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.11,0:05:19.18,TL,,0,0,0,,是他一场场打出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.18,0:05:20.12,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次年终
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.12,0:05:22.54,TL,,0,0,0,,在意大利的主场球迷面前
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.54,0:05:24.51,TL,,0,0,0,,他还能走多远？
